  {
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "id": "reader-panel-label",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "kind": "block",
    "parent": "reader-backdrop",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**Settled: it is a PDF today, and that is regretted — nobody can link to a section.**\n\nThat one sentence decides more than it looks. A PDF in a viewer cannot carry a deep link, cannot let a signal in the text click through to the instrument, and cannot be pointed at in an email or a ticket. Every one of those is a thing people try to do in the surface they spend the most time in.\n\nWhat is *in* the reader is still open — the sections here are still a guess."
   },
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "frameId": "screen-reader",
   "groupIds": [],
   "height": 620,
   "id": "reader-panel",
   "isDeleted": false,
